// Test: Keyword 'rite' ∀ function definition
// Spec: 01-LEXICAL.md § 2.2 Keywords
// Priority: P0
//
// Purpose:
// Validates that the 'rite' keyword works ∀ function definitions.
//
// Expected behavior:
// Should compile and print 42

rite get_value() -> !i32 {
    42
}

rite main() {
    println(get_value());
}
